description:
Bumps the version to 0.7.0 and dates the CHANGELOG section. Merging this makes `package.yml` tag v0.7.0 and publish the GitHub release with the VSIX.

This release contains:
- **Console log filter** (#142): choose which parts of the SAS log the console shows.
- **Compare Datasets** (#143, #144, part of #140): `PROC COMPARE` from the Command Palette, the Data Explorer title bar, the Explorer and the Clinical Repository, with Highlight Differences, Open Differences and Open Side by Side.
- **Dataset details** (#146, part of #140): column labels on hover, Dataset Properties in the Viewer and the Data Connections details editor, and Data Explorers that refresh after console runs.
- **Positron 2026.12 data files** (#147, fixes #141):
  - the SAS viewers coexist with Positron's own `.sas7bdat` / `.xpt` reader;
  - a new **Open with SAS** menu entry and a new `SAS.dataFiles.openWith` setting;
  - local files are copied into WORK when a SAS server can't see them;
  - SAS Server Files datasets open in the Data Explorer.
- **Bug fixes:**
  - per-folder librefs for local `.sas7bdat` files;
  - no more "Silent execution queue full";
  - `LINESIZE` and other options are restored after Data Explorer queries;
  - transport-file tab names;
  - "No active SAS session" no longer ends at an error.

Still based on upstream 1.21.0. Minor bump: a new feature area, and a changed default for opening data files.

